/* DoL-MP v1.2.0-dev8: mp-keepsake-uses.twee (16 passages: 8 Keepsake Use 1 + 8 Keepsake Use 2) */
:: MP Keepsake Use Whistle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
浓雾封锁了雾角栈桥外侧的水道，你取出贴身收着的守塔人铜哨。哨身刻着破雾音孔，对着海雾吹响或许能引来巡海暗标。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收起信物返回 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse_whistle_1 is 1>>
这处暗格今天已经仔细查验过，眼下并无新的动静。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "按旧港讯号吹铜哨 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_whistle_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_whistle_1")>><<money 320>><</if>>低沉穿透的哨音刺破海雾，迷雾深处亮起一盏绿光引航灯，照出礁石间一处干燥暗龛。<span class="green">守塔人铜哨为你引开了海雾水道。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着信物指引上前 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海风倒灌进哨口，呛得你连咳两声，哨音断在了半途。<span class="red">逆风吹哨让你嗓子一阵干痒。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[屏住呼吸重新试探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "旋转哨尾调音环对准潮位 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_whistle_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_whistle_1")>><<money 320>><</if>>精准的共鸣音在海蚀崖壁间回荡，退潮暗礁后露出了守塔人预留的补给木箱。<span class="green">调准音高后铜哨唤出了海岸秘径。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向开启的暗格处 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	调音环被盐霜卡住，拧动时磨红了食指。<span class="red">你擦去盐霜准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[调整手腕角度再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Whistle 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
顺着铜哨引出的绿光踏上背浪礁台，石龛里放着一只打着守塔人火漆的防水铜盒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse_whistle_2 is 1>>
今日的事宜已料理妥当，无需在此处重复费神。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-2">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "用铜哨尾端旋盒盖 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_whistle_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_whistle_2")>><<money 480>><</if>>铜哨尾端正好是防水盒的专用钥匙，盒内整整齐齐码着应急航海银币。<span class="green">你用铜哨开启了守塔人补给盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[持信物深入内层 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	锁簧被海盐锈住，你拨动时铜边硌痛了虎口。<span class="red">你揉了揉虎口暂且松手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[擦净指尖汗水再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "顺防水盒侧面燕尾槽平推 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_whistle_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_whistle_2")>><<money 480>><</if>>燕尾槽顺滑推开，你将里面的航海银币与海图残页一并收起。<span class="green">你从侧面燕尾槽打开了防水铜盒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[借信物共鸣前行 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	燕尾槽里卡着细沙，推到半途便停住不动。<span class="red">你吹去细沙留待再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准器物缝隙再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Core [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
停摆天文台副座的差速凹槽空缺着核心件，你取出那枚蓝钢怀表芯，黄铜齿牙与凹槽尺寸分毫不差。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收起信物返回 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse_core_1 is 1>>
周围一切平静如常，今天不必再往里翻检了。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-core">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "将发条母芯嵌主槽 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_core_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_core_1")>><<money 320>><</if>>母芯落槽的刹那，整座副天球仪嗡然运转，底座侧板滑开露出了一格秘藏。<span class="green">发条母芯重新唤醒了副座星轨。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着信物指引上前 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	主轴槽内残留着一点硬油泥，母芯卡在半途没能彻底咬合。<span class="red">你连忙稳住母芯免得伤到齿牙。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住下盘重心再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "先拨动擒纵叉卸力再旋母芯 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_core_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_core_1")>><<money 320>><</if>>齿轮严丝合缝地咬合转动，星轨指针指向北方暗格，弹出一只丝绒小袋。<span class="green">你用标准钟表匠手法装妥了母芯。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向开启的暗格处 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	擒纵叉回弹碰了一下你的指甲，带来一阵酸麻。<span class="red">你揉了揉手指重新对准槽位。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着纹理走向再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Core 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
随着发条母芯平稳旋转，天文台地面格栅下升起一座小型黄铜校时台，上面扣着一只字码匣。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse_core_2 is 1>>
你今天已经把这里的首尾收拾干净，先回前头歇息吧。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-core-2">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "按母芯背面拨字码 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core-2">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_core_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_core_2")>><<money 480>><</if>>三道字码对齐后匣盖轻巧弹开，里面收着旧钟塔修缮基金的结余银币。<span class="green">你凭母芯暗码打开了校时字码匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[持信物深入内层 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	字码轮咬合极紧，拨动时震麻了食指。<span class="red">你甩了甩手指重新对准。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放缓指尖力道再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "按天球仪赤纬角度旋开底盖 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core-2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_core_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_core_2")>><<money 480>><</if>>底盖旋开后露出整套黄铜校时筹码与修缮银币。<span class="green">你从底盖机关开启了校时字码匣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[借信物共鸣前行 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	底盖螺纹生涩，转了两圈便累得手腕发酸。<span class="red">你记下角度决定稍后再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[借着微光看清再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Ring [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
灰烬藏经阁最里侧的石砌读经台有一处凹陷的八角戒模，你取出修道院银鸽指环，戒面浮雕刚好与凹槽互补。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收起信物返回 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse_ring_1 is 1>>
此处今日已经走过一遭，趁天色尚早去别处转转吧。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-ring">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "将银鸽指环按凹槽 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-ring">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_ring_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_ring_1")>><<money 320>><</if>>石台内部传来低沉的机括声，侧面暗格缓缓滑开，露出一卷泥金古抄本与奉纳金。<span class="green">银鸽指环开启了藏经阁密龛。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着信物指引上前 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石槽内积着一层冷蜡，戒指按下去时滑偏了半寸。<span class="red">冰凉的石台冻得你指尖发麻。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[揉热发僵手指再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "先用烛火温热戒面再嵌凹槽 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-ring">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_ring_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_ring_1")>><<money 320>><</if>>温热的黑曜石融开残蜡严密合拢，石台下方的暗抽屉无声弹出。<span class="green">你巧借烛温解开了读经台印锁。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向开启的暗格处 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	烛泪滴在手指上烫了一下，你连忙缩手。<span class="red">你吹去手背蜡滴准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[听准机括节拍再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Ring 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
读经台暗抽屉里放着一只银箍圣咏匣，匣口留着一道唯有教团执事戒才能挑开的暗簧。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
