<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "按古抄本记载的节拍叩匣盖 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_ring_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_ring_2")>><<money 480>><</if>>机括应声松脱，你顺利取出了圣咏匣内的封存银币。<span class="green">你用教团叩击礼开启了圣咏匣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[借信物共鸣前行 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	叩击节奏差了半拍，内侧锁舌纹丝不动。<span class="red">你平复呼吸准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[避开湿滑边缘再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Amber [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
夜光标本廊尽头的光学比色台上空着标准槽，你取出那枚封着古银脉蜂的琥珀香膏瓶，将其对准折射光路。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收起信物返回 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse_amber_1 is 1>>
暗记与门锁今日已核对无误，留待改日再来留心吧。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-amber">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "将古琥珀放棱镜槽 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-amber">>
