	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_mask_1")>><<money 320>><</if>>侍者一眼认出纯银狐面胸针的首席纹章，不仅未加盘问，还递给你一枚贵宾茶歇筹码。<span class="green">你凭纯银狐面胸针完美混入后台藏品室。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向开启的暗格处 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	高跟地毯边缘让你步点微乱，侍者伸手拦了你一下核对请柬。<span class="red">你借口去补妆暂且退回外廊。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
