<<link "借烛台反光按侧面珍珠母钮 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_mask_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_mask_2")>><<money 480>><</if>>珍珠母钮按下后暗格无声滑开，你收下了里面的不记名筹码。<span class="green">你借珍珠暗钮打开了后台藏品格。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[借信物共鸣前行 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	烛影晃动看岔了位置，按在了普通木饰上。<span class="red">你移近烛台看清位置。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
