	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着信物指引上前 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜框螺纹有一点细微错位，旋入时刮到了你的指腹。<span class="red">你倒退半圈重新对准螺纹。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住下盘重心再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "先用鹿皮擦净镜面配合调焦 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-lens">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse_lens_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use_lens_1")>><<money 320>><</if>>镜面澄澈如水，星光透过透镜在观测台桌面投下一道指向暗抽屉的亮斑。<span class="green">你通过星光投影找到了观测台暗格。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向开启的暗格处 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	调焦手轮转得太快，亮斑一闪而过没能看清落点。<span class="red">你揉了揉发酸的眼睛重新调焦。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着纹理走向再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

